2","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-061","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-panjun","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-061-panjun","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-panjun:line014-pei02-01","quote":"吴书曰：芮玄卒，濬并领玄兵，屯夏口。玄字文表，丹杨人。父祉，字宣嗣，从孙坚征伐有功，坚荐祉为九江太守，后转吴郡，所在有声。玄兄良，字文鸾，随孙策平定江东，策以为会稽东部都尉，卒，玄领良兵，拜奋武中郎将，以功封溧阳侯。权为子登拣择淑媛，群臣咸称玄父祉兄良并以德义文武显名三世，故遂娉玄女为妃焉。黄武五年卒，权甚愍惜之。","source_term":"玄父祉兄良"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu061-panjun-0","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"a1c_ag0_842_AA","label":"芮氏〔芮玄女、孫登妃〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-061","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-panjun","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-061-panjun","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-panjun:line014-pei02-01","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-panjun:line014-pei02-01:m0141","quote":"女"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"a1c_ag0_842_A","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-061","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-panjun","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-061-panjun","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-panjun:line014-pei02-01","quote":"吴书曰：芮玄卒，濬并领玄兵，屯夏口。玄字文表，丹杨人。父祉，字宣嗣，从孙坚征伐有功，坚荐祉为九江太守，后转吴郡，所在有声。玄兄良，字文鸾，随孙策平定江东，策以为会稽东部都尉，卒，玄领良兵，拜奋武中郎将，以功封溧阳侯。权为子登拣择淑媛，群臣咸称玄父祉兄良并以德义文武显名三世，故遂娉玄女为妃焉。黄武五年卒，权甚愍惜之。","source_term":"娉玄女为妃"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu061-panjun-2","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-061-panjun","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-061","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-panjun","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-061-panjun:line014-pei02-01:m0141"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-061-panjun:line014-pei02-01"],"t